",[26,1131,1132,1133,1050],{},"CSS-Variablen live bearbeiten (",[29,1134,1135],{},"Eigenes CSS",[26,1137,1138],{},"Eine Theme-Datei in den Themes-Ordner importieren",{"title":149,"searchDepth":150,"depth":150,"links":1140},[1141,1142,1143,1144],{"id":1033,"depth":150,"text":1034},{"id":1067,"depth":150,"text":1068},{"id":1085,"depth":150,"text":1086},{"id":1118,"depth":150,"text":1119},"Farben, Schriften, Buttons und Tabs im Theme Creator gestalten.",{},5,"\u002Ftheme-editor",{"title":1019,"description":1145},"h6Hta3TDDcThnouY3Pk_Omvjq8Eb8knx-HIAvf5YZd8",{"id":1152,"title":1153,"body":1154,"description":1291,"extension":159,"meta":1292,"navigation":161,"order":1293,"path":1294,"seo":1295,"stem":1296,"__hash__":1297},"content_de\u002Frecording-editor.md","Aufnahme-Editor",{"type":7,"value":1155,"toc":1285},[1156,1159,1165,1169,1175,1195,1198,1202,1227,1231,1246,1250,1264,1275],[10,1157,1153],{"id":1158},"aufnahme-editor",[14,1160,1161,1162,1164],{},"Nimm einen Clip in SoundNinja auf, schneide ihn zu und importiere ihn in einen Tab. Öffnen über ",[29,1163,94],{}," in der Player-Leiste.",[18,1166,1168],{"id":1167},"eingang-wählen","Eingang wählen",[14,1170,720,1171,1174],{},[29,1172,1173],{},"Einstellungen → Audio",":",[65,1176,1177,1183,1189],{},[26,1178,1179,1182],{},[29,1180,1181],{},"Eingabegeräte"," — Mikrofon",[26,1184,1185,1188],{},[29,1186,1187],{},"Ausgabegeräte (PC-Audio)"," — Loopback dessen, was der PC spielt",[26,1190,1191,1194],{},[29,1192,1193],{},"Eingangslautstärke"," — Aufnahme-Gain von 0 % bis 200 %",[14,1196,1197],{},"Der Aufnahme-Button nutzt das hier gewählte Gerät.",[18,1199,1201],{"id":1200},"take-bearbeiten","Take bearbeiten",[65,1203,1204,1207,1210,1218,1221,1224],{},[26,1205,1206],{},"Aufnehmen und stoppen",[26,1208,1209],{},"Pegelmesser beobachten",[26,1211,1212,32,1215],{},[29,1213,1214],{},"Normalisieren",[29,1216,1217],{},"Rauschunterdrückung",[26,1219,1220],{},"Ganzen Clip trimmen, auf Auswahl trimmen oder Auswahl löschen",[26,1222,1223],{},"Rückgängig \u002F Wiederholen",[26,1225,1226],{},"Rein- und rauszoomen",[18,1228,1230],{"id":1229},"stagen-und-importieren","Stagen und importieren",[23,1232,1233,1236,1239],{},[26,1234,1235],{},"Auswahl oder ganzen Track zur Staging-Liste hinzufügen.",[26,1237,1238],{},"Die Liste startet leer: aufnehmen, bearbeiten, dann Clip hinzufügen.",[26,1240,1241,32,1243,1245],{},[29,1242,98],{},[29,1244,101],{}," in den aktuellen oder einen gewählten Tab.",[18,1247,1249],{"id":1248},"stem-trennung-optional","Stem-Trennung (optional)",[14,1251,1252,1253,1256,1257,32,1260,1263],{},"Offizielle Windows-, macOS- und Linux-Release-Builds enthalten das ",[29,1254,1255],{},"Stems","-Feature. Der Aufnahme-Editor kann ",[29,1258,1259],{},"Gesang",[29,1261,1262],{},"Musik"," mit BS-RoFormer behalten.",[14,1265,1266,1267,1270,1271,1274],{},"Das Modell ist etwa 158 MB und ",[29,1268,1269],{},"nicht"," im Installer. Download unter ",[29,1272,1273],{},"Einstellungen → Stem-Trennung"," oder über den Erststart-Hinweis. Der Windows-Installer kann den Download beim ersten Start anbieten.",[14,1276,1277,1278,1046,1281,1284],{},"Eigene Source-Builds brauchen extra Flags (",[114,1279,1280],{},"tauri:serve:stems",[114,1282,1283],{},"tauri:build:stems",").",{"title":149,"searchDepth":150,"depth":150,"links":1286},[1287,1288,1289,1290],{"id":1167,"depth":150,"text":1168},{"id":1200,"depth":150,"text":1201},{"id":1229,"depth":150,"text":1230},{"id":1248,"depth":150,"text":1249},"Mikrofon oder PC-Audio aufnehmen, den Clip bearbeiten und aufs Board legen.",{},6,"\u002Frecording-editor",{"title":1153,"description":1291},"recording-editor","mBUN6yUiwk-kNjhsf48NlWEXXhjw6cOuSAkybSa9wi0",{"id":1299,"title":1300,"body":1301,"description":1514,"extension":159,"meta":1515,"navigation":161,"order":1516,"path":1517,"seo":1518,"stem":1519,"__hash__":1520},"content_de\u002Fremote-control.md","Fernsteuerung",{"type":7,"value":1302,"toc":1507},[1303,1306,1309,1313,1343,1346,1349,1384,1388,1408,1411,1415,1447,14